{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22248","headline":"达理二首 一 · 白居易","name":"达理二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何物壮不老，何时穷不通。\n如彼音与律，宛转旋爲宫。\n我命独何薄，多悴而少丰。\n当壮已先衰，暂泰还长穷。\n我无奈命何，委顺以待终。\n命无奈我何，方寸如虚空。\n瞢然与化俱，混然与俗同。\n谁能坐自苦，龃龉於其中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22248.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22248","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}